<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-zhoushu" book-id="b-zhoushu-048" chapter-id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao" source-id="s-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao-ws2432546">
  <p id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao:p001:m0000" ref="0va_s3x_wb4_B">蕭詧</persName>字<persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao:p001:m0003" ref="0va_s3x_wb4_B">理孫</persName>，蘭陵人也，梁武帝之孫，昭明太子<persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao:p001:m0021" ref="0va_s3x_wb4">統</persName>之第三子。</p>
  <p id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao:p002:m0000" ref="0va_s3x_wb4_BA">巋</persName>字<persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao:p002:m0002" ref="0va_s3x_wb4_BA">仁遠</persName>，<persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao:p002:m0005" ref="0va_s3x_wb4_B">詧</persName>之第三子也。</p>
  <p id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao:p003:m0000" ref="0va_s3x_wb4_BB">巖</persName>字<persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao:p003:m0002" ref="0va_s3x_wb4_BB">義遠</persName>，<persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao:p003:m0005" ref="0va_s3x_wb4_B">詧</persName>第五子也。</p>
  <p id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao:p004:m0000" ref="0va_s3x_wb4_BAA">瓛</persName>字<persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao:p004:m0002" ref="0va_s3x_wb4_BAA">欽文</persName>，<persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-xiao:p004:m0005" ref="0va_s3x_wb4_BA">巋</persName>第三子也。</p>
</text>
